From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slothfulchat <patches@slothfulchat.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:37:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 90/90] web-app: jumpToMessage switches accounts itself

useMessage().jumpToMessage now handles a message in another account:
it saves the target chat as that account's last chat, selects the
account, and queues the jump for when its message list mounts
(__internal_jump_to_message_asap). Errors are logged there.

That sequence was copied into CommandPalette and the global voice
player, and the video mini player hid its "Show in Chat" button for
other accounts instead. All three now just call jumpToMessage, so
"Show in Chat" in the video mini player works across accounts too.
GlobalVoiceMessagePlayer loses the accountId prop it only needed for
that check.

Not touched: the notification click path (RuntimeAdapter) and
ForwardMessage, which also close dialogs / open chats on their own.

Closes #276.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
